00:00:23.123 --> 00:00:24.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
Nobody commented.
I was, like, freaking out.

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Speaks indistinctly ]
...Instagram."

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:29.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I tapped her on the shoulde
and I said,

00:00:29.396 --> 00:00:32.966 line:92%
"I've been following you!"

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:37.303 line:92%
And she ran away. She ran away

00:00:37.303 --> 00:00:38.905 line:92%
'Cause I get depressed, too.

00:00:38.905 --> 00:00:40.974 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
I'm normally in dark colors.

00:00:40.974 --> 00:00:42.809 align:start size:94% position:6%
My friend said to me
the other day,

00:00:42.809 --> 00:00:44.110 line:92%
"Why do you always wear black?

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.080
And I'm like, "Oh, 'cause I feel
great about my body

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:50.316 line:92%
and I'm filled with hope."

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:53.420 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean, I have a master's
in social work,

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:54.888 line:92%
