00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:01.528 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's crazy.

00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:02.695 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm trying to take care
of myself,

00:01:02.695 --> 00:01:06.166 align:start size:94% position:6%
