No running around.

00:02:11.064 --> 00:02:15.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
No flushing the toilet.
No opening chips.

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:16.336 size:75% position:38% line:92%
Susan's in turmoil."

00:02:16.336 --> 00:02:19.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "Well,
I just ate six pizzas

00:02:19.506 --> 00:02:25.311 size:88% position:44%
