but good luck to Susan."

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:27.013 size:84% position:42% line:92%
The Roots are laughing.

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:30.416 line:92%
So, I -- That's all I care about

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:32.152 line:92%
