00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:37.190
So, I do a lot of shows in
Florida for very old people.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.959 align:start size:94% position:6%
Most of them are 80, 90.
Some have passed.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:45.365
And I have to make them laugh,
and they have all the same face,

00:02:45.365 --> 00:02:47.033 align:start size:94% position:6%
