00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:01.414
They talk during the whole show,
because they can't stop --

00:03:01.414 --> 00:03:03.483 align:start size:94% position:6%
And they talk loud
'cause they're deaf.

00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:04.651 size:78% position:39% line:92%
This is totally true.

00:03:04.651 --> 00:03:06.019 align:start size:94% position:6%
